				<h1 id="h-vs">Understanding humour: what happens when we <span class="hl">laugh</span>?</h1>
				<p class="dh-lead">Humour does not come from a single formula. Surprise, reappraisal, play, emotion and the social situation can all play a part. If you want to understand why something is funny, you also learn something about how people form expectations, shift meanings and relate to one another.</p>
